    },
    "message": "Record lane G's results, and say which model code moved and who checks partial\n\nAll checks have run on this code: the lane doc has the results. The comments said no coefficient\nlives in world_view.rs and that a rule says Unsupported on a partial view. The misinformation\npressure has its weight, threshold and cap there, and each rule has to check partial itself, so say\nthat; the built extension is byte-identical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
